			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"This soundtrack was composed and performed between the years 2009 to 2013.\r\n\r\nLuis Hernandez plays: DIY EMS Synthi A x2, TR-606, MFOS Sequencer, Space Echo 201, Hohner Tape Echo, Melos Disk Echo, various sampling delay units, nanoloop, Realistic Concertmate MG-1, Sherman Filterbank, Korg Wavedrum, miscellaneous pedals. track 2 on side A programmed on a Yamaha RX21L drum machine. No MIDI or DAW was used for  sequencing or recording."
